OL,3,GNEWSAGarvaghy residents hold out
OL,4,Aprospect for Drumcree deal with SoS
OL,5,Adocument
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Garvaghy Road Residents Coalition
OL,8,F(GRRC) has held out the prospect of an
OL,9,Farrangement to resolve the Drumcree
OL,10,Fdispute after spending almost seven
OL,11,Fhours in discussions with government
OL,12,Fofficials at Hillsborough castle.
OL,14,FAsked what had been discussed, Breandan
OL,15,FMac Cionnaith said: "We received a
OL,16,Fdocument from the secretary of state,
OL,17,Fwe went through it this afternoon.
OL,19,FMac Cionnaith said he "can't divulge"
OL,20,Fwhat is in the document but added:
OL,21,F"Let's say if it's accepted by the
OL,22,FOrange Order it'll be accepted by us."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
