OL,5,Adocument
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe talks came after lawyers for the
OL,8,FGarvaghy Road Residents Coalition
OL,9,Fissued a fresh legal bid on Tuesday to
OL,10,Ftry to prevent the march from going
OL,11,Fahead.
